---
import { SITE } from '../../config/site';
import { toolPath } from '../../i18n';
---

<p>
  {SITE.name} is a set of free PDF tools that anyone can use safely. With nothing but a web browser — no installation and no account —
  you can merge, split, reorder, compress and convert PDF files.
</p>

<h2>PDF tools that never upload your files</h2>
<p>
  Most online PDF services upload your files to their servers. {SITE.name} uses WebAssembly and modern browser technology to do
  <strong>all processing on your own device</strong>. Contracts, certificates and ID copies never leave your computer, and there is no
  waiting for uploads or downloads.
</p>

<h2>Tools</h2>
<ul>
  <li><a href={toolPath('en', 'merge')}>Merge PDF</a>, <a href={toolPath('en', 'split')}>Split PDF</a></li>
  <li>
    <a href={toolPath('en', 'organize')}>Organize PDF</a> (reorder, rotate, delete, duplicate, blank pages),
    <a href={toolPath('en', 'rotate')}>Rotate</a>, <a href={toolPath('en', 'delete-pages')}>Delete pages</a>,
    <a href={toolPath('en', 'extract-pages')}>Extract pages</a>
  </li>
  <li><a href={toolPath('en', 'compress')}>Compress PDF</a></li>
  <li><a href={toolPath('en', 'jpg-to-pdf')}>JPG to PDF</a>, <a href={toolPath('en', 'pdf-to-jpg')}>PDF to JPG</a></li>
  <li><a href={toolPath('en', 'watermark')}>Watermark</a>, <a href={toolPath('en', 'page-numbers')}>Page numbers</a></li>
  <li><a href={toolPath('en', 'protect')}>Protect</a>, <a href={toolPath('en', 'unlock')}>Unlock</a></li>
</ul>

<h2>How the site is funded</h2>
<p>
  Every tool is free. The site is supported by the ads shown on its pages. Because files are not processed on servers, running costs stay
  low, so there are no limits on usage or file size.
</p>

<h2>Open source</h2>
<p>This service is built on these open-source projects:</p>
<ul>
  <li><a href="https://github.com/cantoo-scribe/pdf-lib" rel="noopener">pdf-lib (@cantoo/pdf-lib)</a> — MIT License</li>
  <li><a href="https://mozilla.github.io/pdf.js/" rel="noopener">PDF.js</a> — Apache License 2.0</li>
  <li><a href="https://github.com/101arrowz/fflate" rel="noopener">fflate</a> — MIT License</li>
  <li><a href="https://preactjs.com/" rel="noopener">Preact</a>, <a href="https://astro.build/" rel="noopener">Astro</a> — MIT License</li>
</ul>

<h2>Contact</h2>
<p>
  {
    SITE.contactEmail ? (
      <>
        Suggestions, bug reports and partnership inquiries: <a href={`mailto:${SITE.contactEmail}`}>{SITE.contactEmail}</a>
      </>
    ) : (
      'Please contact the site operator with suggestions or bug reports.'
    )
  }
</p>
